#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_website.core_homepage_docs
msgid "<i class=\"fa fa-flash text-info me-2\"/> <strong>Action (Generate KRS):</strong> Click \"Generate KRS\" on the Package, and the system will filter students of that program who have not created KRS. Check dozens of student names, and mass <em>Draft KRS</em> (with their subject lines) will be issued in the blink of an eye!"
